Pepper|bell peppers]]\n* 2–3 [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] or grated\n* 3–4 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], crushed\n* [[Cookbook:Sunflower Oil|Sunflower oil]]\n* [[Cookbook:Vinegar|Vinegar]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Parsley|Parsley]], finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# [[Cookbook:Roasting|Roast]] the aubergines and peppers on a hot plate. Remove the skins, and cut into small pieces.\n# Add the tomatoes, then the crushed garlic.\n# Mix with a wooden spoon, then add oil, vinegar, and salt to taste. Beat together well.\n# Pour into a plate and top with finely chopped parsley.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using eggplant]]\n[[Category:Bulgarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bell pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Kyopulo (Eggplant with Peppers and Tomatoes)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2–3 aubergines","sourceText":"2–3 aubergines","amountText":"2–3 aubergines","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"4–5 bell peppers","sourceText":"4–5 bell peppers","amountText":"4–5 bell peppers","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2–3 tomatoes, diced or grated","sourceText":"2–3 tomatoes, diced or grated","amountText":"2–3 tomatoes, diced or grated","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3–4 cloves garlic, crushed","sourceText":"3–4 cloves garlic, crushed","amountText":"3–4 cloves garlic, crushed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Sunflower oil","sourceText":"Sunflower oil","amountText":"Sunflower oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Vinegar","sourceText":"Vinegar","amountText":"Vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Sa